      "rows": [
        {
          "dimension": "Smart-contract / Exploit",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Echo Protocol's suspected exploit — where a 1K eBTC mint enabled max-borrow of WBTC on Curvance — demonstrated that novel parallel execution introduces edge-case state hazards that standard EVM audits may not catch.",
