        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "A 27% team token allocation and unresolved accusations that Monad's consensus derives from Avalanche's codebase both point to concentrated technical and economic control that contradicts its decentralized L1 positioning.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Coinbase listing of MON for US users and the Mastercard partnership increase regulatory surface area, particularly around whether MON qualifies as a security given its structured sale at a fixed FDV.",
