        },
        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Despite surpassing $350M TVL rapidly post-launch, analysts flagged weak fee generation relative to locked capital, suggesting incentive-driven deposits that may exit once reward programs wind down.",
